menu "Topology Reporter"

    config TOPOLOGY_REPORTER_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Topology heartbeat report interval (ms)"
        default 30000
        help
            While attached (role_manager_is_upstream_ready() and role is
            LEAF or INTERMEDIATE) with nothing else to report, send a
            TOPOLOGY_REPORT_HEARTBEAT this often. Should be comfortably
            shorter than the power base's own configured
            heartbeat_timeout_ms/topology_stale_timeout_ms (see
            power_base_config.h and configs/power_base.json) so a
            momentarily-delayed report is not mistaken for a real detach.

endmenu
